{"id":"4d3551c550ac217a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md","title":"Kubota–Leopoldt p-adic L-function","display":"df-kubota-leopoldt — Kubota–Leopoldt p-adic L-function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kubota-leopoldt","aliases":["58-df-kubota-leopoldt","Kubota-Leopoldt"],"display":"df-kubota-leopoldt — Kubota–Leopoldt p-adic L-function","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-p-adic.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kubota-leopoldt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kubota-leopoldt</span><span>Kubota-Leopoldt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kubota-leopoldt — Kubota–Leopoldt p-adic L-function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8006c9bacc56d123\" href=\"?note=8006c9bacc56d123\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-p-adic.md\">../batch07/58-df-p-adic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da478762d021f626\" href=\"?note=da478762d021f626\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md\">../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_p,p,\\chi\\in V\">\\(L_p,p,\\chi\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p,\\widehat d,i)\">\\((K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p,\\widehat d,i)\\)</span> is an explicitly bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic presentation, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:\\mathbb Q\\to K_p\">\\(i:\\mathbb Q\\to K_p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Arithmetic in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_p\">\\(K_p\\)</span>, including subtraction, powers, and division by nonzero elements, is derived from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p\">\\(+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padic\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}character}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S(\\psi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nq\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\psi,\\mathbb Z,K_p)\n\\land\\psi(1)=1_p\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\psi(mn)=\\cdot_p(\\langle\\psi(m),\\psi(n)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\psi(n+q)=\\psi(n))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\psi(n)=0_p\\leftrightarrow\\gcd(n,q)&gt;1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padic\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}character}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S(\\psi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nq\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\psi,\\mathbb Z,K_p)\n\\land\\psi(1)=1_p\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\psi(mn)=\\cdot_p(\\langle\\psi(m),\\psi(n)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\psi(n+q)=\\psi(n))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\psi(n)=0_p\\leftrightarrow\\gcd(n,q)&gt;1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padic\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\n(F,X,K_p,\\widehat d,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,C,r)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,K_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,X,K_p^\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,X,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n\\Bigl(\\widehat d(x,y)&lt;r(x)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}{}\\bigl(\nm\\geq N\\to\n\\widehat d\\bigl(\nF(y),\n\\sum_{j&lt;m}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p(\\langle C(x)(j),(y-_px)^j\\rangle)\n\\bigr)&lt;\\varepsilon\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padic\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\n(F,X,K_p,\\widehat d,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,C,r)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,K_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,X,K_p^\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,X,\\mathbb R_{&gt;0})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n\\Bigl(\\widehat d(x,y)&lt;r(x)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}{}\\bigl(\nm\\geq N\\to\n\\widehat d\\bigl(\nF(y),\n\\sum_{j&lt;m}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p(\\langle C(x)(j),(y-_px)^j\\rangle)\n\\bigr)&lt;\\varepsilon\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}bernoulli\\text{-}coefficient}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\n(b,n,\\psi,q,B,i,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S(\\psi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land b=\n\\cdot_p\\Biggl\\langle i(q^{\\,n-1}),\n\\sum_{a=1}^{q}{}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p\\Biggl\\langle\n\\psi(a),\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n}{}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p\\biggl\\langle\ni\\!\\left(\\binom nk B(k)\\right),\ni\\!\\left(\\frac aq\\right)^{n-k}\n\\biggr\\rangle\n\\Biggr\\rangle\n\\Biggr\\rangle .\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}bernoulli\\text{-}coefficient}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\n(b,n,\\psi,q,B,i,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S(\\psi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land b=\n\\cdot_p\\Biggl\\langle i(q^{\\,n-1}),\n\\sum_{a=1}^{q}{}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p\\Biggl\\langle\n\\psi(a),\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n}{}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p\\biggl\\langle\ni\\!\\left(\\binom nk B(k)\\right),\ni\\!\\left(\\frac aq\\right)^{n-k}\n\\biggr\\rangle\n\\Biggr\\rangle\n\\Biggr\\rangle .\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kubota\\text{-}leopoldt}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S(L_p,p,\\chi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists K_p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p,X,P_\\chi,C,r,q,\\omega,\n\\chi_\\bullet,B_\\bullet,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S\n(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land X=\\{x\\in K_p:\\widehat d(x,0_p)\\leq1\\}\n\\land P_\\chi\\subseteq\\{i(1)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\n(L_p,X\\setminus P_\\chi,K_p,\\widehat d,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,C,r)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\chi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\omega,p,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\Bigl(\\gcd(z,p)=1\\to\n\\bigl(\\omega(z)^{p-1}=1_p\n\\land\\widehat d(\\omega(z),i(z))&lt;1\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi_\\bullet,\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},K_p^{\\mathbb Z})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_\\bullet,\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},K_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists q_n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nq_n=\\operatorname{lcm}(q,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\chi_\\bullet(n),q_n,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(p\\mid z\\to\\chi_\\bullet(n)(z)=0_p\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}{}\\land\n\\bigl(p\\nmid z\\to\\exists u\\in K_p\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\cdot_p(\\langle\\omega(z)^n,u\\rangle)=1_p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18em}{}\n\\land\\chi_\\bullet(n)(z)=\\cdot_p(\\langle\\chi(z),u\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\n(B_\\bullet(n),n,\\chi_\\bullet(n),q_n,B,i,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\chi_\\bullet(n)(-1)=i((-1)^n)\\to\nL_p(i(1-n))\n=-_p\\cdot_p\\Bigl\\langle\n1_p-_p\\cdot_p(\\langle\\chi_\\bullet(n)(p),i(p^{n-1})\\rangle),\n\\cdot_p(\\langle B_\\bullet(n),i(n)^{-1}\\rangle)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kubota\\text{-}leopoldt}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S(L_p,p,\\chi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists K_p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p,X,P_\\chi,C,r,q,\\omega,\n\\chi_\\bullet,B_\\bullet,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S\n(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land X=\\{x\\in K_p:\\widehat d(x,0_p)\\leq1\\}\n\\land P_\\chi\\subseteq\\{i(1)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\n(L_p,X\\setminus P_\\chi,K_p,\\widehat d,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,C,r)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\chi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\omega,p,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\Bigl(\\gcd(z,p)=1\\to\n\\bigl(\\omega(z)^{p-1}=1_p\n\\land\\widehat d(\\omega(z),i(z))&lt;1\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi_\\bullet,\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},K_p^{\\mathbb Z})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_\\bullet,\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},K_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists q_n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nq_n=\\operatorname{lcm}(q,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\chi_\\bullet(n),q_n,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(p\\mid z\\to\\chi_\\bullet(n)(z)=0_p\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}{}\\land\n\\bigl(p\\nmid z\\to\\exists u\\in K_p\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\cdot_p(\\langle\\omega(z)^n,u\\rangle)=1_p\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18em}{}\n\\land\\chi_\\bullet(n)(z)=\\cdot_p(\\langle\\chi(z),u\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\n(B_\\bullet(n),n,\\chi_\\bullet(n),q_n,B,i,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\chi_\\bullet(n)(-1)=i((-1)^n)\\to\nL_p(i(1-n))\n=-_p\\cdot_p\\Bigl\\langle\n1_p-_p\\cdot_p(\\langle\\chi_\\bullet(n)(p),i(p^{n-1})\\rangle),\n\\cdot_p(\\langle B_\\bullet(n),i(n)^{-1}\\rangle)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Local <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic analyticity is witnessed by convergent power-series coefficients away from the optional pole set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\chi\\subseteq\\{i(1)\\}\">\\(P_\\chi\\subseteq\\{i(1)\\}\\)</span>; this includes the simple-pole possibility for the trivial character.</li>\n<li>The Teichmüller character is constrained by its root-of-unity and residue-lift properties, and each twisted character and generalized Bernoulli coefficient is set-coded.</li>\n<li>The interpolation equation is written entirely in the bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic field presentation. Analytic continuation, existence, and uniqueness are downstream theorems rather than hidden assumptions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Washington, Introduction to Cyclotomic Fields</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-p-adic.md","status":"resolved","id":"8006c9bacc56d123","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-p-adic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md","status":"resolved","id":"da478762d021f626","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-bernoulli-numbers.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_p,p,\\chi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"(K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p,\\widehat d,i)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"i:\\mathbb Q\\to K_p","display":false},{"tex":"K_p","display":false},{"tex":"+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padic\\text{-}dirichlet\\text{-}character}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S(\\psi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nq\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\psi,\\mathbb Z,K_p)\n\\land\\psi(1)=1_p\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\psi(mn)=\\cdot_p(\\langle\\psi(m),\\psi(n)\\rangle)\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;(\\psi(n+q)=\\psi(n))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\bigl(\\psi(n)=0_p\\leftrightarrow\\gcd(n,q)>1\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}padic\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}witness}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\n(F,X,K_p,\\widehat d,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,C,r)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,X,K_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(C,X,K_p^\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(r,X,\\mathbb R_{>0})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n\\Bigl(\\widehat d(x,y)<r(x)\\to\n\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\\\\n&\\hspace{5em}{}\\bigl(\nm\\geq N\\to\n\\widehat d\\bigl(\nF(y),\n\\sum_{j<m}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p(\\langle C(x)(j),(y-_px)^j\\rangle)\n\\bigr)<\\varepsilon\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}bernoulli\\text{-}coefficient}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\n(b,n,\\psi,q,B,i,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S(\\psi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&{}\\land b=\n\\cdot_p\\Biggl\\langle i(q^{\\,n-1}),\n\\sum_{a=1}^{q}{}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p\\Biggl\\langle\n\\psi(a),\n\\sum_{k=0}^{n}{}^{+_p}\n\\cdot_p\\biggl\\langle\ni\\!\\left(\\binom nk B(k)\\right),\ni\\!\\left(\\frac aq\\right)^{n-k}\n\\biggr\\rangle\n\\Biggr\\rangle\n\\Biggr\\rangle .\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kubota\\text{-}leopoldt}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S(L_p,p,\\chi)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists K_p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p,X,P_\\chi,C,r,q,\\omega,\n\\chi_\\bullet,B_\\bullet,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n&\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S\n(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&{}\\land X=\\{x\\in K_p:\\widehat d(x,0_p)\\leq1\\}\n\\land P_\\chi\\subseteq\\{i(1)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicAnalyticWitness}_S\n(L_p,X\\setminus P_\\chi,K_p,\\widehat d,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,C,r)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\chi,q,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\omega,p,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\Bigl(\\gcd(z,p)=1\\to\n\\bigl(\\omega(z)^{p-1}=1_p\n\\land\\widehat d(\\omega(z),i(z))<1\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\chi_\\bullet,\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},K_p^{\\mathbb Z})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_\\bullet,\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},K_p)\n\\land\\mathrm{BernoulliSequence}_S(B)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists q_n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nq_n=\\operatorname{lcm}(q,p)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{PadicDirichletChar}_S\n(\\chi_\\bullet(n),q_n,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(p\\mid z\\to\\chi_\\bullet(n)(z)=0_p\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}{}\\land\n\\bigl(p\\nmid z\\to\\exists u\\in K_p\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\cdot_p(\\langle\\omega(z)^n,u\\rangle)=1_p\\\\\n&\\hspace{18em}{}\n\\land\\chi_\\bullet(n)(z)=\\cdot_p(\\langle\\chi(z),u\\rangle)\n\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\n\\mathrm{GeneralizedBernoulliCoefficient}_S\n(B_\\bullet(n),n,\\chi_\\bullet(n),q_n,B,i,K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\n\\Bigl(\n\\chi_\\bullet(n)(-1)=i((-1)^n)\\to\nL_p(i(1-n))\n=-_p\\cdot_p\\Bigl\\langle\n1_p-_p\\cdot_p(\\langle\\chi_\\bullet(n)(p),i(p^{n-1})\\rangle),\n\\cdot_p(\\langle B_\\bullet(n),i(n)^{-1}\\rangle)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"P_\\chi\\subseteq\\{i(1)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":5258,"backlinks":[{"id":"7abdef002bccc371","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KubotaLeopoldt}_S$ (Kubota–Leopoldt $p$-进 $L$ 函数谓词, see [[../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-746","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-kubota-leopoldt.md|58-df-kubota-leopoldt]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["8006c9bacc56d123","3322615e4eea05e9","da478762d021f626","36d7463d215be751"]}